  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 1004.01 Federal Provisions. All New Hampshire tobacco licensees shall abide by all federal laws, regulations, and rules governing the sale, packaging, distribution and advertising of tobacco products, e-cigarettes and liquid nicotine.\n\nSource. #6668, eff 1-1-98, EXPIRED: 1-1-06\n\nNew. #12082, eff 1-6-17",
